    "explanation": "catalog-svc briefly lost one of four instances (line 126) and was back within a minute (line 129). But search-api retries 503s immediately with backoff disabled (lines 130, 139, 146, 152), multiplying load on catalog-svc past its capacity so it keeps shedding (lines 137, 153, 165). The overload sustains itself long after the trigger; the shed requests (lines 142, 148, 161, 169, 177) and edge 503s (lines 136, 141, 155, 166, 168, 173, 184) are symptoms. Fix the retry policy / add a retry budget. Red herrings: line 65 (a single long GC pause in a healthy service, with heap well below limits); line 57 (a certificate expiry reminder weeks out).",
